<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57091" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηλάς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>, ἡ, prop.<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mottled</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηλίς</span>),
			of clouds denoting wind, not rain, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				31
			</span></i>, prob.in <i><span class="en">
				51
			</span></i>: hence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἡμέρα</span> a
				<i>windy</i> day, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				63
			</span></i> P. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηλὰς αἴξ, ἡ</span>, a she-goat <i>with a mark</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σημεῖον τυλοειδές</span>) <i>on her
			forehead</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
